{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>週末想搵個地方一次過滿足購物、打卡、玩樂同收藏慾？嚟大圍圍方就啱晒！商場集結本地文創、潮流玩具、動漫周邊、集換式卡牌及室內遊樂場等，由興趣玩到收藏，為大家一站式解鎖流行文化與休閒娛樂。11月仲有全港首個木棉花快閃店！無論係動漫迷、卡牌玩家，定係想帶小朋友放電嘅家長，呢度都有齊心水之選，等著大家嚟逐一...</p>\n<p>\n週末想搵個地方一次過滿足購物、打卡、玩樂同收藏慾？嚟大圍圍方就啱晒！商場集結本地文創、潮流玩具、動漫周邊、集換式卡牌及室內遊樂場等，由興趣玩到收藏，為大家一站式解鎖流行文化與休閒娛樂。11月仲有全港首個木棉花快閃店！無論係動漫迷、卡牌玩家，定係想帶小朋友放電嘅家長，呢度都有齊心水之選，等著大家嚟逐一探索！\n</p>\n<h3><strong>全港首個木棉花快閃店「MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動」</strong></h3>\n<p>今個11月，由木棉花與動漫聯動聯手打造嘅全港首個木棉花快閃店「MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動」登陸圍方 L2 中庭，集合 36 套超人氣動漫作品，一次過帶來超過 900 款熱門及獨家周邊商品，由實體化嘅《全職獵人》貪婪之島卡冊、《家庭教師》彭哥列戒指收藏盒，再到首發嘅聖誕造型高速婆婆公仔都有，仲有主題扭蛋機同抽卡區等大家試手氣～</p>\n<p>除咗買周邊，場內多個打卡位亦好吸睛，包括首次來港嘅 1:1《HUNTER x HUNTER 全職獵人》主角小剛同基路亞立體雕像、約3米高嘅超巨型《DAN DA DAN》高速婆婆，超萌嘅《鬼滅之刃》禰豆子同胡蝶忍等，逢週末下午高速婆婆更會親身現身同大家影相合照！</p>\n<p><strong>MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動詳情</strong><br/>\n地址：大圍圍方商場 L2 中庭<br/>\n活動日期：2026 年 11 月 11 日至 23 日<br/>\n營業時間：12：00 – 21:00（11 月 23 日為12：00 – 18:00）</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00060_pop_fest_thewaimail-3_17700750126afbfdc22ce3d-1024x681.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"638\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00060_pop_fest_thewaimail-3_17700750126afbfdc22ce3d-1024x681.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00070_pop_fest_thewaimail-2_9464248856afbfdb28efcd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"638\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00070_pop_fest_thewaimail-2_9464248856afbfdb28efcd-1024x681.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00032_pop_fest_thewaimail-1_7808296826afbfdb9b2081.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"638\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00032_pop_fest_thewaimail-1_7808296826afbfdb9b2081-1024x681.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00083_pop_fest_thewaimail_17782118256afbfdae05a1e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"638\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026_derek_00083_pop_fest_thewaimail_17782118256afbfdae05a1e-1024x681.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><strong>動漫聯動：正版授權動漫周邊尋寶地</strong></h3>\n<p>動漫聯動係 Microworks 旗下主打動漫嘅品牌，致力推廣動漫文化，售賣正版授權動漫周邊及玩具。店內嘅產品種類都非常多，由動漫精品、Figure 人偶景品、生活家品、服裝、文具、漫畫小說，到海報、砌圖及絨毛公仔都有！同時，品牌亦會聯同各大動漫代理商合作舉辦活動，持續將動漫文化帶入日常生活。想為自己搵收藏品，或者買動漫精品送畀朋友，都可以到店內尋寶！</p>\n<p>地址：大圍圍方商場 5 樓 512 號舖<br/>\n營業時間：星期一至五 12:00 – 21:00；星期六、日 11:00 – 21:00</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_6248_9663022396afbe5d8cd185-1024x768.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：動漫聯動）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_6248_9663022396afbe5d8cd185-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：動漫聯動）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-27_16633636286afbe5d232fa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-27_16633636286afbe5d232fa4-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：動漫聯動）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-_19592465266afbe5d5db755.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-_19592465266afbe5d5db755-1024x512.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：動漫聯動）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bushiroad-creative-ver.-vol.2-1-5_8397511726afbe5de25eb2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bushiroad-creative-ver.-vol.2-1-5_8397511726afbe5de25eb2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：動漫聯動）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><strong>Marktoys：延續玩具王國傳奇</strong></h3>\n<p>香港曾經係全球最大嘅玩具出口地，而擁有超過二十年門市歷史嘅 Marktoys 就一直保持住呢種對玩具嘅熱誠，堅持推動玩具文化。店內貨品種類繁多，由新奇有趣嘅玩具、禮品、擺設，到人偶cosplay服、一比一度身訂做玩具以及電影道具用品都有。品牌由產品構思、設計、研發、改良、生產，以至零售、批發及售後服務都有涉獵，無論係想買玩具、搵家居擺設、收藏人偶，定係純粹入店參觀打卡，都絕對可以喺度搵到新奇有趣嘅玩意！</p>\n<p>地址：大圍圍方商場 5 樓 523A 號舖<br/>\n營業時間：星期一至日 11:00 – 22:00</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.40.57_12555047456afbfac6cb297-1024x768.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：Marktoys）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.40.57_12555047456afbfac6cb297-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Marktoys）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.40.56_10113813896afbfac9091f2.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"856\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.40.56_10113813896afbfac9091f2-1024x913.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Marktoys）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.41.00-2_16322719746afbfac4bd0a7.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.41.00-2_16322719746afbfac4bd0a7-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Marktoys）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.40.55_5882016226afbfacb70197.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"878\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-09-14-at-16.40.55_5882016226afbfacb70197-1024x937.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Marktoys）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><b>冒險樂園 Planet J：潮玩室內遊樂場</b></h3>\n<p>放假想帶小朋友盡情放電？冒險樂園專為各位潮人及潮爸潮媽打造嘅全新室內遊樂場品牌Planet J Hong Kong 就啱晒大家喇！一站式網羅各種最新最潮嘅玩意，無論大人定細路都可以喺度搵到專屬嘅樂趣，絕對係消閒放鬆、享受 family day 嘅好去處！</p>\n<p>地址：大圍圍方商場 5 樓 510 – 511 號舖<br/>\n營業時間：星期一至日 10:30 – 22:00</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.24-pm-1_19578636426afbfaddf3f22-1024x339.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：冒險樂園 Planet J）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"318\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.24-pm-1_19578636426afbfaddf3f22-1024x339.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：冒險樂園 Planet J）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.24-pm_21135224996afbfadf9649f.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.24-pm_21135224996afbfadf9649f-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：冒險樂園 Planet J）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.24-pm-2_17062011026afbfae386f94.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.24-pm-2_17062011026afbfae386f94-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：冒險樂園 Planet J）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.25-pm-1_20091686276afbfae1a35c2.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-07-29-at-12.46.25-pm-1_20091686276afbfae1a35c2-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：冒險樂園 Planet J）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><strong>Cardzoku：寶可夢 &amp; TCG 卡牌玩家必去</strong></h3>\n<p>由寶可夢愛好者創立嘅 Cardzoku，致力為玩家與收藏家打造一個值得信賴嘅交流平台。呢間本地TCG 卡牌專門店提供日版原裝補充盒、精選單卡、PSA／CGC／BGS 國際鑑定卡，以及不同卡牌保護配件。除咗買卡，店舖更設有專業估價收卡、代客送鑑同線上拍賣等一站式透明服務，對寶可夢及集換式卡牌有興趣嘅朋友，可以預留時間嚟慢慢睇卡～</p>\n<p>地址：大圍圍方商場 5 樓 523B 號舖<br/>\n營業時間：星期一至日 11:00 – 21:00</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cardzoku-shop-front_7787612606afbfaf90dd95-1024x768.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：Cardzoku）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cardzoku-shop-front_7787612606afbfaf90dd95-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Cardzoku）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-02-at-13.29.31_1062657996afbfafd7e0b6.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1268\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-02-at-13.29.31_1062657996afbfafd7e0b6-1024x1353.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Cardzoku）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-02-at-13.29.30_4217973796afbfafbc9be2.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-02-at-13.29.30_4217973796afbfafbc9be2-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Cardzoku）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-02-at-13.29.28_8674755776afbfaff5bd3d.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-02-at-13.29.28_8674755776afbfaff5bd3d-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Cardzoku）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><strong>Figurecross：本地原創品牌&amp;潮流選物集中地</strong></h3>\n<p>Figurecross 係一個集結本地原創設計、潮流玩物同特色選物嘅crossed hub，精選超過 50 個品牌，涵蓋手作、玩具、紙品、港漫及書本等唔同類型。圍方分店更佈設有與香港插畫家 Mean Production 聯乘嘅佈置以及一齊推出嘅「社畜動物餅T-Shirt」，等大家可以邊行街邊打卡。店內仲有多款有趣嘅人氣商品，例如「懷孕動物盲盒」、帶有香港色彩嘅舒壓按鍵及牌仔等，畀大家行街之餘亦都可以認識本地設計及手作文化。</p>\n<p>地址：大圍圍方商場 4 樓 406A 號舖<br/>\n營業時間：星期一至五 12:00 – 20:00；星期六、日 11:30 – 20:30</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_2035214896afbfb0a7049b-1024x768.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：Figurecross）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_2035214896afbfb0a7049b-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Figurecross）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/product_7065138536afbfb07cb192.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/product_7065138536afbfb07cb192-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Figurecross）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/product-2_19655094566afbfb03bb3cd.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/product-2_19655094566afbfb03bb3cd-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Figurecross）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/product-3_10050692406afbfb053b244.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/product-3_10050692406afbfb053b244-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Figurecross）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><b>更多玩樂商店等你探索</b></h3>\n<p>圍方嘅休閒娛樂體驗又點止咁少～商場內仲有多間特色玩樂及生活選物店等住大家去發掘，行足全日都唔會悶！</p>\n<p><strong>名創優品：</strong>以親民價格入手各種人氣 IP 聯名、潮玩盲盒、家居好物、包袋配飾及數碼產品。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_3134714916afbfb0d61e06-1024x768.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：名創優品）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_3134714916afbfb0d61e06-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：名創優品）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>NSEW：</strong>Nintendo Switch 一站式遊戲體驗店，為玩家提供 Nintendo Switch 正規硬件、配件及遊戲軟件，為消費者提供方向搵到合適遊戲產品。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-17-2.58.49_20749691356afbfb3d831b6-1024x762.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：NSEW）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"714\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-17-2.58.49_20749691356afbfb3d831b6-1024x762.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：NSEW）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>NAMCO</b><b>：</b>人氣日本遊戲機中心，提供各種日本流行景品及遊戲體驗，最啱朋友聚會或一家大細一齊玩。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/r6_s5427.jpg_15015023706afbfb498ec54-1024x683.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：NAMCO）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/r6_s5427.jpg_15015023706afbfb498ec54-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：NAMCO）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>TINY微影</b><b>：</b>主打極具香港特色嘅玩具及生活精品，透過香港交通工具合金模型、微縮情景、建築組件及授權跨界商品，將香港人熟悉嘅城市記憶定格，變成可以保存嘅收藏品。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_17408651246afbfb540b79f-1024x753.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：TINY微影）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"706\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_17408651246afbfb540b79f-1024x753.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TINY微影）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>奇趣天地：</b>集合人氣玩具模型、文具禮品及生活精品，最適合想搵特色小物、或者買禮物嘅朋友。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_18526997366afbfb5ecc21f-1024x626.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圍方 （圖片來源：奇趣天地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"587\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/shop-front_18526997366afbfb5ecc21f-1024x626.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：奇趣天地）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>圍方集合唔同興趣嘅玩樂選擇，一次過涵蓋本地文創、玩具收藏，到動漫、卡牌及遊戲體驗，下次想搵個唔怕落雨、又可以由朝玩到晚嘅週末好去處，不妨約埋朋友或一家大細，到圍方發掘屬於自己嘅玩樂路線啦！</p>\n<p>即日起至11月23日，圍方更推出「Cosplay Unlock」活動。Cosplay任何動漫角色可解鎖多個商戶限定禮遇，發掘精彩獎賞，動漫迷絕對唔可以錯過呀！推廣期內，於參與商戶憑電子貨幣單一消費滿HK$500或以上，仲可以賺取雙倍MTR分！</p>\n<p>*各店舖營業時間及店內安排或會有所更改，出發前建議先向相關店舖查詢。</p>\n<p>*優惠受條款及細則約束。</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.673023+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3238,"images":29,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:33.292673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:01.379978+00:00","content_hash":"27dab5a8189183fdc0d61eb0b9011c314d23b516f99eae8affaa5d4a78e60d10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}